e SMARTer™ Ultra Low RNA Kit for Illumina Sequencing (Clontech Cat. No. 634935) using 20 PCR cycles. The amplified cDNA was fragmented by sonication (Bioruptor, Diagenode). Paired-end sequence adaptors were ligated to DNA fragments, followed by size selection (300 bp E-Gel® Agarose Gel Electrophoresis System of Invitrogen) and 14 cycles of PCR amplification.	181610754	36322150800	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR105/002/SRR1051322/SRR1051322_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR105/002/SRR1051322/SRR1051322_2.fastq.gz	348ac100518cea64341d098650d0051e;39c737307fbed7cb03cce78bc7f87115	14529801027;14893424549
